{
  "name": "opus-bambu-paragraph",
  "elapsedMs": 2483,
  "result": {
    "text": "When switching between different filaments for printing on a single nozzle (hotend) printer, it is necessary to use a certain amount of new material to flush the residual material in the hotend, to avoid color mixing during printing. The flushing values vary between different materials, and the specific values can be viewed on the filament page of Bambu Studio. You can refer to the wiki to learn more: Reduce Waste during Filament Change",
    "targetLanguage": "zh",
    "response": {
      "success": true,
      "result": "当在单喷嘴(热门)打印机上打印时,在不同的丝状之间切换时,必须使用一定量的新材料冲洗热端中的残余物质,以避免在打印过程中混合颜色。 冲洗值因材料不同而异,具体值可在班布工作室的丝状页上查看。 您可以引用wiki 来学习更多: 在 filament 变化中减少废物"
    },
    "milliseconds": 2460.2000000476837
  },
